sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant App as Flutter App / Web
  participant API as API (NestJS)
  participant Cart as Cart Service
  participant Inv as Inventory Service
  participant Ord as Order Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Queue Worker
  participant N as Notifications (FCM/SMS)

  C->>App: Open cart & tap "Checkout"
  App->>API: GET /cart (JWT)
  API->>Cart: Load cart items
  Cart->>DB: SELECT cart_items
  DB-->>Cart: items
  Cart-->>API: cart summary
  API-->>App: Cart + totals
  C->>App: Select address + COD, confirm
  App->>API: POST /orders {addressId, paymentMethod: COD}
  API->>Inv: Check stock for all items
  Inv->>DB: SELECT stock
  alt Stock available
    API->>Ord: Create order (status = PENDING)
    Ord->>DB: INSERT order + order_items
    Ord->>Inv: Reserve / decrement stock
    Inv->>DB: UPDATE stock
    Ord->>DB: INSERT payment (method=COD, status=PENDING)
    DB-->>Ord: committed
    Ord-->>API: order created (orderNumber)
    API->>Q: Dispatch OrderPlaced job
    Q->>N: Send confirmation (push + SMS)
    N-->>C: "Order #SB-1024 confirmed"
    API-->>App: 201 Created {order}
    App-->>C: Show confirmation & tracking
  else Out of stock
    API-->>App: 409 Conflict {unavailable items}
    App-->>C: Prompt to update cart
  end
